# Tutor Overlay - environment variables
# Copy this to .env.local and fill in real values.
# .env.local is git-ignored and must never be committed.

# AI provider for v1 (cloud vision model)
# Pick one provider and fill in the key. The app should be wired to read
# one active provider from env, with the model choice also configurable.
# Example shape only - update when the backend AI module is wired.

# AI_PROVIDER=openai
# AI_MODEL=gpt-5-mini
# AI_API_KEY=your_key_here

# If you prefer a different provider, add its fields here and update
# src-tauri/src/commands/ai.rs (or the equivalent module) to read them.
